  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernising Official Data and Statistics</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">High-quality statistics and data are essential for evidence-based decision-making. This ONS project supports national statistical offices in low- and middle-income countries to strengthen their capacity through peer-to-peer partnerships and UK statistical expertise. Through targeted technical assistance, the project helps partners modernise statistical systems, improve data quality, and produce trusted statistics that improve lives and support sustainable development.</narrative>
  </description>
